<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><atom:link href="https://www.aboutamazon.com/rss/feed.rss" type="application/rss+xml" rel="self"/><title>Amazon News</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link><description>Amazon News RSS Feed</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:03:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><image><title>Amazon News</title><url>https://assets.aboutamazon.com/f2/a4/a07ef04d49df8b93eb283512a0fc/amazon-news-newsletter-beige.png</url><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/amazon-news-today</link></image><item><title>Prime Video’s ‘Fourth Wing’ series casts Esther McGregor and Emilio Sakraya as leads</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/fourth-wing-cast-violet-xaden-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>Esther McGregor and Emilio Sakraya will play dragon riders Violet Sorrengail and Xaden Riorson in Prime Video’s adaptation of Rebecca Yarros’ best-selling novels.</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:27:10 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/fourth-wing-cast-violet-xaden-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/621b8c8/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F04%2F88%2F351846924f6798af2e91654f25fd%2Ffourth-wing-casting-amazon-news-nb-102126.jpg"/></item><item><title>Blink debuts its first 4K, spotlight, and pan-tilt cameras, plus an expanded XR lineup</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/blink-4k-long-range-security-cameras?utm_source=rss</link><description>The new lineup delivers higher resolution, broader coverage, and extended range to help customers see more of what’s happening around their homes and properties.</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:55:18 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/blink-4k-long-range-security-cameras</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/73b79c4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fdf%2F19%2F5c2f5e894c9d9be22bf00f3e860c%2Fblinkcameras-hero-amazonnews-ck101925.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon commits 30,000 jobs to young people in the UK by 2030—no experience required</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-youth-promise-uk?utm_source=rss</link><description>The Amazon Youth Promise will also see 10,000 work experience places open to young people in the UK. </description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:25:08 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/company-news/amazon-youth-promise-uk</guid><category>Company news</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/e56c4bb/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fcd%2F99%2F72c7f5be4e44a9cfc6a1e3f867b7%2Funtitled-20-october-2026-at-13-50-15-5.png"/></item><item><title>Amazon is creating over 300,000 new US jobs this holiday season with increased pay and expanded benefits</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/workplace/amazon-holiday-jobs-2026-seasonal-hiring-healthcare?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon offers industry-leading benefits based on role and tenure, and starting January 1, 2027, eligible seasonal employees will have access to healthcare coverage from their first day on the job.</description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:30:09 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/workplace/amazon-holiday-jobs-2026-seasonal-hiring-healthcare</guid><category>Workplace</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/a329b56/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fc9%2F54%2F17d2f2a94a66b3df367a7a4105e6%2Fabout-amazon-inline-053a4824.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon announces plan to invest €16 billion in Germany in 2027</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/company-news/amazon-germany-investment?utm_source=rss</link><description>Since 2010, Amazon has invested over €100 billion in Germany, underscoring the country as one of the most important to Amazon worldwide. </description><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:04:23 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/company-news/amazon-germany-investment</guid><category>Company news</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/5540d74/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fad%2F71%2Ffddd808c455787fe13706f07b8c9%2Finvestment-hero-2000x1125-2.jpg"/></item><item><title>Watch the trailer for ‘Drive – The Pretenders,’ coming to Prime Video October 28</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/drive-the-pretenders-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>The romantic movie, inspired by the hit novel &apos;Drive,&apos; follows a mechanic who fakes an engagement to a scandalous racing star—with a passion that could destroy them both.</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:00:24 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/drive-the-pretenders-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/c211da5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1600x901+0+0/resize/767x432!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F0e%2Fa6%2Fb7efbae544cab9562a55f830a139%2Frncf-11.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon opens its AWS Trainium AI chips to every PyTorch developer, no rewrite needed</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/innovation-at-amazon/torchneuron-pytorch-aws-trainium-chips-ai?utm_source=rss</link><description>TorchNeuron lets developers run their existing AI code on AWS Trainium chips with virtually no changes, reducing the friction to adopting new hardware.</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:00:10 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/innovation-at-amazon/torchneuron-pytorch-aws-trainium-chips-ai</guid><category>Innovation at Amazon</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/f66c60b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F8a%2F19%2F8a5b8b1542a18aea511b89378867%2Faws-torchneuron-terminal-inline.gif"/></item><item><title>Amazon invests in nuclear energy project targeting nearly 1 gigawatt of carbon-free energy for Indiana</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/sustainability/amazon-nuclear-energy-indiana-x-energy-aep?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon, X-energy, and AEP are collaborating to explore building small modular reactors in Indiana that would add carbon-free power to the regional grid.</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:30:08 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/sustainability/amazon-nuclear-energy-indiana-x-energy-aep</guid><category>Sustainability</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/565bf32/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fe5%2F6b%2Fda74c82e45bf9f7d89f50e61b39a%2Fabout-amazon-hero-hero-springtide-3.jpg"/></item><item><title>Shop top deals from Amazon’s 2026 Holiday Beauty Event</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-holiday-beauty-event-2026?utm_source=rss</link><description>The two-week event runs through November 1, with deals up to 30% off across beauty categories.</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:13:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-holiday-beauty-event-2026</guid><category>Retail</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/7db1780/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F44%2Ff0%2F5c1c22304df691060a6025e50b33%2Fholiday-event-hero-amazon-news-10122026.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon data center communities: Here’s what’s happening near data centers across the US</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Get the latest updates on how Amazon supports small businesses, creates jobs, sets up sustainability initiatives, and develops educational programs near AWS data centers.</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:12:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/amazon-data-centers-locations-news</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/6081627/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2962x2962+1155+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fa3%2Ff6%2F0abb1c1a4734ba2e727893e6eae2%2Faws-data-center-exterior-1.jpg"/></item></channel></rss>